    {
      "title": "Re-summarize tokens by channel (rate, cost visibility)",
      "description": "tg_resummarize_tokens_total{channel_id, provider, model, token_type}. Wave 2 added the channel_id label, so per-channel token cost is now broken out here (channel_id=\"-\" = card unknown). Use this to see which channel drives re-summarize spend when RESUMMARIZE_MAX_AGE_DAYS is enabled.",
      "type": "timeseries",
