    {
      "title": "Re-summarize trigger split (counter vs age)",
      "description": "tg_resummarize_total{trigger}. Wave 2 trigger label: counter = new_items_since_last_summary >= RESUMMARIZE_TRIGGER_N, age = selected only by the RESUMMARIZE_MAX_AGE_DAYS=14 time-based predicate, '-' = path where the trigger can't be determined (locked / no_card / no_bundle / direct force). Use the age share to see how much RESUMMARIZE_MAX_AGE_DAYS contributes to re-summarize volume.",
