    },
    {
      "title": "Re-summarize trigger split (24h increase)",
      "description": "tg_resummarize_total counter-vs-age contribution over the last 24h. A growing 'age' bar quantifies how much the RESUMMARIZE_MAX_AGE_DAYS=14 freshness trigger adds on top of the counter trigger.",
